# THE ACCEPTANCE RUN for the docker profile's type checking.
# run: bin/metatron-docker build console --boot bin/test/typer-console.boot.mtron \
#        --steps bin/test/typer-console.steps --cwd /work
# No WAIT on the answers: what this script reproduced was exactly that no answer arrived.
# Before Marko's percent::T definition fix it died with StackOverflowError (ArrayList.equalsRange,
# Type.Helper.testTypePoly) and answered nothing; now sys_stat() answers and the session continues.
WAIT_CONSOLE
SLEEP 1
NOTE confirm the checks are on
SEND *</compiler/typer/check>
SLEEP 2
NOTE the frame that died in production — it must answer, with sane percentages
SEND sys_stat()
SLEEP 8
NOTE and the session must still answer
SEND 1+2
SLEEP 2
